{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1788785141","published":"2026-09-07T12:45:51Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:40.142890830Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-14669"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-14669","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: Heap buffer overflow in to_char(timestamptz).\n     DCH_to_char() copies the timezone abbreviation into a\n     DCH_MAX_ITEM_SIZ-budgeted workspace with an unchecked strcpy(), and\n     any client can select a longer POSIX abbreviation via SET TIME ZONE\n     (CVSS 8.8, arbitrary code execution as the database OS user).\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-14669.patch: reject POSIX timezone\n       abbreviations longer than n->key->len * DCH_MAX_ITEM_SIZ in the\n       TZ/tz items of DCH_to_char() with an error, instead of strcpy()ing\n       them past the palloc'd buffer (upstream 3d724bf4fd by Tom Lane,\n       carried on REL_14_STABLE inside 5fb3c63 and shipped in 14.24;\n       applies verbatim to 12.22).\n     - CVE-2026-14669","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libecpg-compat3","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libecpg-compat3?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"12.22-0ubuntu0.20.04.4+tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu20.04els/CLSA-2026-1788785141.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libecpg-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libecpg-dev?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"12.22-0ubuntu0.20.04.4+tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu20.04els/CLSA-2026-1788785141.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libecpg6","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libecpg6?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"12.22-0ubuntu0.20.04.4+tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"sourc